{"seq":1,"slug":"user-tier-quota","title":"用户分级配额：将限流策略与商业模式绑定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-rate-limiting-patterns/patterns/user-tier-quota","wordCount":709,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"用户分级配额-将限流策略与商业模式绑定\">用户分级配额：将限流策略与商业模式绑定</h1><p>用户分级配额（Tiered Quota）是将限流策略差异化的核心机制。对于 SaaS 产品，不同订阅套餐对应不同的 API 访问权限；对于平台型产品，VIP 用户应该比普通用户获得更高的速率上限。分级配额将「技术限制」和「商业权益」绑定在一起。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>用户分级配额将限流策略与商业套餐绑定——免费用户、基础用户、专业用户和企业用户拥有不同的速率上限和总量配额。关键区分：<strong>速率限制</strong>（Rate Limit）控制短时密集度，防止突刺；<strong>配额</strong>（Quota）控制周期总量，防止超量。两者需要同时配置。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[请求] --&gt; B{速率检查&lt;br/&gt;短时窗口}&#10;    B -- 通过 --&gt; C{配额检查&lt;br/&gt;周期总量}&#10;    C -- 通过 --&gt; D[处理请求]&#10;    B -- 超限 --&gt; E[429&lt;br/&gt;rate_limit]&#10;    C -- 超限 --&gt; F[429&lt;br/&gt;quota_exceeded]&#10;    F --&gt; G{用户套餐}&#10;    G -- 免费用户 --&gt; H[升级引导]&#10;    G -- 付费用户 --&gt; I[重置倒计时]\">graph TD\n    A[请求] --&gt; B{速率检查&lt;br/&gt;短时窗口}\n    B -- 通过 --&gt; C{配额检查&lt;br/&gt;周期总量}\n    C -- 通过 --&gt; D[处理请求]\n    B -- 超限 --&gt; E[429&lt;br/&gt;rate_limit]\n    C -- 超限 --&gt; F[429&lt;br/&gt;quota_exceeded]\n    F --&gt; G{用户套餐}\n    G -- 免费用户 --&gt; H[升级引导]\n    G -- 付费用户 --&gt; I[重置倒计时]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>套餐</th>\n<th>速率限制</th>\n<th>日配额</th>\n<th>突发容量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>免费 Free</td>\n<td>20/小时</td>\n<td>100/天</td>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基础 Basic</td>\n<td>100/小时</td>\n<td>1,000/天</td>\n<td>30</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>专业 Pro</td>\n<td>500/小时</td>\n<td>10,000/天</td>\n<td>200</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>企业 Enterprise</td>\n<td>10,000/小时</td>\n<td>自定义</td>\n<td>1,000</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"分级设计原则\">分级设计原则</h2><h3 id=\"三层配额体系\">三层配额体系</h3><p>典型的 SaaS API 配额体系：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[免费套餐 Free] --&gt; B[基础套餐 Basic]&#10;    B --&gt; C[专业套餐 Pro]&#10;    C --&gt; D[企业套餐 Enterprise]&#10;    A -- &quot;100 req/day&lt;br/&gt;无 burst&quot; --&gt; E[用户感知]&#10;    B -- &quot;1000 req/day&lt;br/&gt;burst=50&quot; --&gt; E&#10;    C -- &quot;10k req/day&lt;br/&gt;burst=200&quot; --&gt; E&#10;    D -- &quot;自定义&lt;br/&gt;SLA 保障&quot; --&gt; E\">graph TD\n    A[免费套餐 Free] --&gt; B[基础套餐 Basic]\n    B --&gt; C[专业套餐 Pro]\n    C --&gt; D[企业套餐 Enterprise]\n    A -- \"100 req/day&lt;br/&gt;无 burst\" --&gt; E[用户感知]\n    B -- \"1000 req/day&lt;br/&gt;burst=50\" --&gt; E\n    C -- \"10k req/day&lt;br/&gt;burst=200\" --&gt; E\n    D -- \"自定义&lt;br/&gt;SLA 保障\" --&gt; E</pre><p>设计分级时的三个核心参数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例（Pro 套餐）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>rate_limit</code></td>\n<td>每时间窗口的最大请求数</td>\n<td>10,000/天, 500/小时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>burst_capacity</code></td>\n<td>令牌桶容量（短时突发上限）</td>\n<td>200</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>quota_reset</code></td>\n<td>配额重置周期</td>\n<td>每自然日 00:00 UTC</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"配额-vs-速率限制\">配额 vs 速率限制</h3><p>这是两个不同概念，需要同时设置：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>速率限制</strong>（Rate Limit）：短时间维度，防止单位时间内请求过于密集（如每秒不超过 10 个）</li>\n<li><strong>配额</strong>（Quota）：长时间维度，限制周期内的总用量（如每天不超过 10000 个）</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 一个请求需要同时通过两个检查&#10;async function checkAccess(userId, tier) {&#10;  const config = TIER_CONFIG[tier];&#10;&#10;  // 检查速率限制（防止突刺）&#10;  const rateOk = await rateLimiter.isAllowed(`rate:${userId}`, {&#10;    limit: config.burstCapacity,&#10;    windowMs: 60_000, // 1 分钟窗口&#10;  });&#10;  if (!rateOk) return { allowed: false, reason: &#39;rate_limit&#39; };&#10;&#10;  // 检查日配额（防止超量）&#10;  const quotaOk = await quotaChecker.isAllowed(`quota:${userId}`, {&#10;    limit: config.dailyQuota,&#10;    windowMs: 86_400_000, // 24 小时窗口&#10;  });&#10;  if (!quotaOk) return { allowed: false, reason: &#39;quota_exceeded&#39; };&#10;&#10;  return { allowed: true };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 一个请求需要同时通过两个检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> checkAccess</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> TIER_CONFIG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[tier];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 检查速率限制（防止突刺）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> rateOk</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rateLimiter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isAllowed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`rate:${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    limit: config.burstCapacity,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    windowMs: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60_000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1 分钟窗口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">rateOk) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { allowed: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rate_limit'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 检查日配额（防止超量）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> quotaOk</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quotaChecker.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isAllowed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`quota:${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    limit: config.dailyQuota,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    windowMs: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">86_400_000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 24 小时窗口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">quotaOk) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { allowed: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'quota_exceeded'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { allowed: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"配额存储与计算\">配额存储与计算</h2><h3 id=\"redis-hash-存储配额状态\">Redis Hash 存储配额状态</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 配额存储结构&#10;// HSET user:{userId}:quota:{date}&#10;//   used   {number}    已用配额&#10;//   limit  {number}    配额上限（冗余存储，便于查询）&#10;//   tier   {string}    套餐等级&#10;&#10;async function consumeQuota(redis, userId, cost = 1) {&#10;  const today = new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10); // &quot;2026-07-04&quot;&#10;  const key = `user:${userId}:quota:${today}`;&#10;&#10;  // Lua 脚本：原子查询+递增&#10;  const script = `&#10;    local key = KEYS[1]&#10;    local cost = tonumber(ARGV[1])&#10;    local limit = tonumber(ARGV[2])&#10;&#10;    local used = tonumber(redis.call(&#39;HGET&#39;, key, &#39;used&#39;)) or 0&#10;    if used + cost &gt; limit then&#10;      return {0, used, limit - used}&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    local new_used = redis.call(&#39;HINCRBY&#39;, key, &#39;used&#39;, cost)&#10;    -- 确保 key 在明天过期&#10;    redis.call(&#39;EXPIREAT&#39;, key, ARGV[3])&#10;    return {1, new_used, limit - new_used}&#10;  `;&#10;&#10;  const tomorrowMidnight = getTomorrowMidnightUnix();&#10;  const tierLimit = await getUserTierLimit(userId);&#10;&#10;  const [allowed, used, remaining] = await redis.eval(script, {&#10;    keys: [key],&#10;    arguments: [String(cost), String(tierLimit), String(tomorrowMidnight)],&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return { allowed: allowed === 1, used, remaining };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 配额存储结构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// HSET user:{userId}:quota:{date}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//   used   {number}    已用配额</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//   limit  {number}    配额上限（冗余存储，便于查询）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//   tier   {string}    套餐等级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><