场景</th>\n<th>响应策略</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>免费用户触顶</td>\n<td>429 + 升级引导</td>\n<td>转化机会</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>付费用户触顶</td>\n<td>429 + 重置时间</td>\n<td>告知恢复时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>企业用户触顶</td>\n<td>限流但不拒绝（软上限）</td>\n<td>SLA 承诺</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>API 调用超限</td>\n<td>429 + 当前套餐信息</td>\n<td>帮助开发者理解</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"function buildRateLimitResponse(reason, userId, quotaInfo, tierConfig) {&#10;  if (reason === &#39;quota_exceeded&#39;) {&#10;    return {&#10;      status: 429,&#10;      body: {&#10;        error: &#39;quota_exceeded&#39;,&#10;        message: `您的 ${quotaInfo.tier} 套餐配额已用完`,&#10;        quota: { limit: quotaInfo.limit, used: quotaInfo.used },&#10;        reset_at: quotaInfo.resetAt,&#10;        // 免费用户额外提供升级引导&#10;        ...(quotaInfo.tier === &#39;free&#39; &amp;&amp; {&#10;          upgrade_url: &#39;https://example.com/pricing&#39;,&#10;          upgrade_message: &#39;升级到 Basic 套餐，获得 10 倍配额&#39;,&#10;        }),&#10;      },&#10;    };&#10;  }&#10;  // ... 其他情况&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> buildRateLimitResponse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">reason</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">quotaInfo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tierConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (reason </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'quota_exceeded'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      status: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">429</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      body: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        error: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'quota_exceeded'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        message: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`您的 ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">quotaInfo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tier</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} 套餐配额已用完`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        quota: { limit: quotaInfo.limit, used: quotaInfo.used },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        reset_at: quotaInfo.resetAt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 免费用户额外提供升级引导</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        ...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(quotaInfo.tier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'free'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          upgrade_url: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://example.com/pricing'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          upgrade_message: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'升级到 Basic 套餐，获得 10 倍配额'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // ... 其他情况</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分级配额需要同时管理「速率限制」（防突刺）和「配额」（防超量）两个维度</li>\n<li>Redis Hash 存储日配额状态，用 Lua 脚本保证原子性</li>\n<li>配额超限时，免费用户是转化机会，应附带升级引导；付费用户需要明确的重置时间</li>\n<li>预警 Header（<code>X-Quota-Warning</code>）让前端可以在被拒绝之前主动响应</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>兄弟文档：<a href=\"retry-backoff-patterns\">重试与退避模式</a> 讲解客户端在配额耗尽后如何优雅重试；第四章 <a href=\"../frontend/rate-limit-ux\">限流用户体验</a> 展示如何将配额信息呈现给终端用户。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"用户分级配额：将限流策略与商业模式绑定","id":"用户分级配额-将限流策略与商业模式绑定"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"分级设计原则","id":"分级设计原则"},{"level":3,"text":"三层配额体系","id":"三层配额体系"},{"level":3,"text":"配额 vs 速率限制","id":"配额-vs-速率限制"},{"level":2,"text":"配额存储与计算","id":"配额存储与计算"},{"level":3,"text":"Redis Hash 存储配额状态","id":"redis-hash-存储配额状态"},{"level":3,"text":"套餐配置管理","id":"套餐配置管理"},{"level":2,"text":"配额预警与通知","id":"配额预警与通知"},{"level":2,"text":"配额超限的差异化响应","id":"配额超限的差异化响应"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"API 网关限流：在基础设施层统一管控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-rate-limiting-patterns/implementation/api-gateway-rate-limiting"},"next":{"title":"重试与退避模式：指数退避、抖动算法与重试预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-rate-limiting-patterns/patterns/retry-backoff-patterns"}}